  "body": "Without this, when you build the from the `source` file locally, you get mojibake when viewing the rendered spec output.\n\nBut I don’t feel strongly about adding this, and maybe there’s a reason that Hixie never has added it, and it’s no hardship to just manually use a browser View >  Encoding option to change to viewing it in UTF-8. So I’m fine with just closing this out if we think it’s not needed. \n",
